    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if i'm not strong enough to do that? what if i'm just the person that the pattern stops at? like, if everything i do just leads back to the same misery for me and eventually for my kids if i have any... maybe the only way to actually save them from seeing it all happen is to just not be there to pass it on. it feels like the only way to actually win is to not play the game at all.",
